     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><div>Which website are you looking at?  <a href=\"http://datadr.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://datadr.org&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792495148292000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Wf8BJoUNocZkqVxZYJ47x\">datadr.org</a> is out of date.  We have moved to <a href=\"http://tessera.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://tessera.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792495148292000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1rIDJh33Eu_L55Ugt4cbEe\">tessera.io</a>.  There you can find instructions to get set up with a vagrant vm.  This is easier to keep up to date because we just update the provisioning scripts instead of an entire image.  Take a look there and see if that will help.</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><br><div><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div>On Jan 31, 2015, at 4:37 AM, <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">rh...@googlegroups.com</a> wrote:</div><br><div>\r\n<div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(211,211,211);max-width:850px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">\r\n  <div style=\"background-color:#f5f5f5;padding:10px 20px\">\r\n    <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%\">\r\n      <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n          <td style=\"width:70%\">\r\n            <span style=\"font:18px/20px arial;color:#333333\">\r\n              <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email#!forum/rhipe/topics\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:#333333\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail%23!forum/rhipe/topics&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792495148292000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3K6yoQrbXIePaxUNe6w3gr\">\r\n              rh...@googlegroups.com</a>\r\n            </span>\r\n          </td>\r\n          <td style=\"text-align:right;width:30%\">\r\n            <spa